<title>POLAND: Farm Food group net at PLN 8.6 mln in 96.</title>
<headline>Farm Food group net at PLN 8.6 mln in 96.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farm Food results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     18.00</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 11.19</p>
<p>    Group net profit				8.61</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Farm Food SA. The company did not report its group results for 1995.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     325.50</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			284.18</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit		  0.45</p>
<p>    Group income tax				4.27</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			     0.02</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		    3.42</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			11.51</p>
<p>    Group investment				0.11</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
